# 12. Model Development vs Application Development

Perbedaan yang sangat berguna untuk dipahami:

```text
              AI / ML SYSTEM
                    │
        ┌───────────┴───────────┐
        ↓                       ↓
   Model Layer            Application Layer
        │                       │
        ↓                       ↓
   Training                 Backend
   Evaluation               API
   Inference                Frontend
   Optimization             Business Logic
        │                       │
        └───────────┬───────────┘
                    ↓
                Production
```

ML Engineer sering lebih dekat dengan:

```text
Model Layer
+
ML Infrastructure
```

AI Engineer sering lebih dekat dengan:

```text
Application Layer
+
AI Integration
```

Namun keduanya tetap overlap.

